      "html_code": "<div style='background:#0f1114;color:#e4e4e7;font-family:Cascadia Code,monospace;padding:36px;min-height:420px;font-size:19px;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-bottom:26px;'><div class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;border:2px solid #f3c969;padding:14px 18px;'>pp</div><svg class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;' width='90' height='40'><line x1='0' y1='20' x2='80' y2='20' stroke='#f3c969' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='80' stroke-dashoffset='80'/></svg><div class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;border:2px solid #e4e4e7;padding:14px 18px;'>p</div><svg class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;' width='90' height='40'><line x1='0' y1='20' x2='80' y2='20' stroke='#e4e4e7' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='80' stroke-dashoffset='80'/></svg><div class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;border:2px solid #e4e4e7;padding:14px 18px;'>节点</div></div><div class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;border-left:4px solid #f3c969;padding-left:14px;margin-bottom:14px;'>pp 存 p 的地址</div><div class='reveal-p8' style='opacity:0;border-left:4px solid #f3c969;padding-left:14px;'>解引用两次改到头指针</div><style>.reveal-p8.is-active{opacity:1 !important;animation:fp8 .6s forwards;}@keyframes fp8{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}</style></div>",
      "animation_trigger": "reveal-p8",
      "quiz": null
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "speech_intro": "最后咱们把几个高频雷区过一遍，这些可都是考试和调试时最爱踩的坑。第一个，返回局部变量的地址，函数一结束栈就没了，你返回的地址指向的是垃圾。第二个，指针没初始化就拿来用，野指针乱指，写进去就是灾难。第三个，类型不匹配，比如把 int 地址当 char 指针用，解引用时字节数不对，越界写就来了。咱们把这三条并排摆出来，你记牢了能少熬好几个夜。",
      "html_code": "<div style='background:#0f1114;color:#e4e4e7;font-family:Cascadia Code,monospace;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:22px;padding:36px;min-height:420px;font-size:19px;'><div class='reveal-p9' style='opacity:0;border-top:4px solid #f3c969;padding-top:14px;'>返回局部变量地址<br><span style='color:#f3c969;'>栈已释放</span></div><div class='reveal-p9' style='opacity:0;border-top:4px solid #f3c969;padding-top:14px;'>指针未初始化<br><span style='color:#f3c969;'>野指针</span></div><div class='reveal-p9' style='opacity:0;border-top:4px solid #f3c969;padding-top:14px;'>类型不匹配<br><span style='color:#f3c969;'>越界写</span></div><style>.reveal-p9.is-active{opacity:1 !important;animation:fp9 .5s forwards;}@keyframes fp9{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}</style></div>",
